the setup.py install path here writes straight into --root=/usr with no regard
for DESTDIR, which would land the module on the live system during packaging,
and setuptools 80 dropped the install command outright. hudkeywords is pure
python with a console script, so cmake can place both itself. python3 by name
too, the bare "python" lookup is how a python2 interpreter used to sneak in.

